  "description": "A man who is flawless in every way—looks, physique, personality, and professional ability. Jihan is truly perfect. Miju has secretly been in love with her boss Jihan, but just when it seems she has no chance at all, she hears the news that Jihan has been transferred to the head office. Feeling like she has no more time to hesitate, she decides to confess her feelings… However, things don’t go as she expected, and in the midst of it all, she realizes something. This perfect man seems to be hiding something!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/perfect_guy), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/perfect_guy), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000076567), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13799333), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260124) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/perfect_guy)",
